# What `SC0101` has left to report now that the top level admits statements:
# a token that can begin neither half of it.
#
# The message names both halves. Until `script-mode.md` §8.1 landed it named
# only declarations and carried the note "a module holds declarations only; a
# statement belongs in a function body" — a grammar commitment that lived in
# shipped diagnostic text and was never argued for. The first clause of it
# stopped being true the day the top level gained a second production, and
# this case is what would have caught it.

)
